OL,3,GNEWSADirty Sanchez star honours Michael
OL,4,A'Pancho' Locke on Everest trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tribute flag to Michael "Pancho"
OL,7,FLocke has reached Everest Base Camp
OL,8,Fafter his former Dirty Sanchez co-star
OL,9,FMathew Pritchard dedicated his
OL,10,FHimalayan trek to the Welsh TV star and
OL,11,Fentrepreneur.
OL,13,FLocke's former co-conspirator on the
OL,14,FMTV stunt and prank series had already
OL,15,Fstarted the challenge when he learned
OL,16,Fof the news of Locke's death on Friday.
OL,18,FThe Cardiff presenter and skateboarder
OL,19,Fsaid he was now heading home to "give
OL,20,FPanch a send-off", after spending the
OL,21,Fjourney reflecting on more than 35
OL,22,Fyears of friendship.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
