OL,3,GNEWSADirty Sanchez star honours Michael
OL,4,A'Pancho' Locke on Everest trek
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He had the biggest heart and was one
OL,7,Fof the kindest souls you could ever
OL,8,Fmeet," he said, adding there was
OL,9,F"never, ever a dull moment" with Locke.
